{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112075748598-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112112710\"/><p>元朗區聯同相關部門人員昨日（11日）於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。</p><p>行動中，人員共拘捕21名內地女子，年齡介乎18至73歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查。據了解，被捕女子年齡最大73歲，在案中角色亦涉及賣淫。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.300841+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:57:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.813975+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:28.480937+00:00","content_hash":"969965cc411f46eca7b7e301c250d6db709c11920596c7fd08c77fbb59d2b6bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.300841+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}